@startuml
title AEB 10ms Task Sequence Diagram (Dynamic Behavior)

actor OS_Scheduler
participant "context: Aeb_SystemContext" as AEB
participant "Radar: IRadarSensor" as Radar
participant "Camera: ICameraSensor" as Camera
participant "Brake: IBrakeActuator" as Brake

OS_Scheduler -> AEB: Aeb_MainFunction_10ms()
activate AEB

AEB -> Radar: GetSensorStatus()
activate Radar
Radar --> AEB: status (0x00)
deactivate Radar

AEB -> Radar: GetRadarTarget(&radarTarget)
activate Radar
Radar --> AEB: radarTarget data
deactivate Radar

AEB -> AEB: CalculateTTC(&radarTarget)
activate AEB
note right of AEB: target.Distance_M / relSpeed_Mps
deactivate AEB

AEB -> Camera: IsPedestrianDetected()
activate Camera
Camera --> AEB: TRUE / FALSE
deactivate Camera

alt CalculatedTTC < 1.5s
  AEB -> Brake: ApplyEmergencyBrake(100.0)
  activate Brake
  Brake --> AEB: done
  deactivate Brake
else TTC >= 1.5s or No Target
  AEB -> Brake: ReleaseBrake()
  activate Brake
  Brake --> AEB: done
  deactivate Brake
end

deactivate AEB

note over AEB
  주의: Gemini 원본 시퀀스에는 GetCameraTarget() 호출이
  포함되어 있었으나, 실제 Aeb_FusionEngine.c 에는 없음.
  --> 코드 기준으로 정정한 버전 (REVIEW.md D-1 참조)
end note
@enduml
